# Scope / 适用范围

This MIT license covers **the original parts of this repository**: the VS Code
extension (`src/`, `media/`) and the local proxy runtime
(`proxy/`) as published here.

本 MIT 许可覆盖**本仓库的原创部分**：VS Code 扩展（`src/`、`media/`）
与本地代理运行时（`proxy/`）。

Third-party material is **not** covered by this license. This repository contains
no third-party project files, but parts of `proxy/` are ported from MIT-licensed
work. Those attributions are recorded in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` and must be
retained when redistributing.

第三方内容不在此许可范围内。本仓库不包含任何第三方项目的文件本体，但
`proxy/` 的部分实现移植自 MIT 许可的项目，相关归属与许可原文见
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md`，分发时必须随附保留。
